{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"screen\": \"前一段的昂扬像慢慢退潮，他忍不住自问：【我刚才是真的相信那些话】，还是只是在努力让自己相信？\",\n      \"source\": \"也可以听成：如果换一种感受，这里不像重新获得活力，更像前一段的昂扬正在慢慢退潮。音乐变得流动、含蓄、若有所思，仿佛心里冒出一句自问：“我刚才是真的相信那些话，还是只是在努力让自己相信？”\",\n      \"type\": 6,\n      \"severity\": \"严重\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿将这句话限定为音乐引发的一种可能联想（仿佛心里冒出），屏幕稿却写成他确实忍不住自问，把听感想象变成了人物实际的内心念头。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"screen\": \"一个熟悉的动作、一次舞蹈、一段曾经习以为常的生活突然闯进来，越具体，越容易意识到自己已经失去了什么。\",\n      \"source\": \"另一个可以同时浮现的联想，是一种非常具体、非常生活化的记忆突然闯进深沉的感受里：一个熟悉的动作、一次舞蹈、一段曾经习以为常的生活。这样的亲切感未必安慰人；恰恰因为那些细节具体而熟悉，反而更容易意识到自己已经失去了什么。\",\n      \"type\": 6,\n      \"severity\": \"严重\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿明确将其作为听音乐时可能浮现的联想，屏幕稿却把它接入人物叙事，写成他的具体记忆确实突然闯入，改变了人物经历和心理活动的确定性。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "23c25d2f-d148-4c56-b5f3-60dac0c33ea9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T053321979851Z", "elapsed_seconds": 367.343, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T05:39:29.347493+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7924064f6439a2a77761e316c2453db3a5fa68349c1ea448983f67584f46ac1a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T053321979851Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "21f8fe6d138a5a7adc0f1386f8117be8d6d11d4d3d4f8b26d2a562f7e6beb96a"}}}
